From: Amaral Adreno Tools <rickamaral94@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [LAB ONLY] tu: bounded A740 readback path counters at command recording

Base is 5.7.8.1 BANDWIDTH; no PROFILED tuning. Preserve GPU command emission,
barriers and format selection. Count alignment fallbacks before optimizing.
512 regions per log, thread-local batches, no addresses or image contents.
Not a performance build; counters measure recording, not completion/timing.

